Yes (or polyself into incubus/succubus).  You can test it out yourself
in Wizmode.

Put on rings of polymorph control and free action.
Wield a potion of paralysis. (keep more potions in your bag)
face the Wiz.
Use the "EyeOfA to levelport to sokoban, with the Wiz following you.
Hit the Wiz with the potion.
Wield an Artifact with a high + to hit.
Use /WoPoly to polymorph into a nymph or foocubus.
Attack the Wiz until you steal the book from him.
Teleport him away.
Levelport (cursed ?oTele) back to the VotDead
de-polymorph back into yourself

If you can get the Wiz to paralyze himself by attacking a floating eye
(you can be the floating eye, BTW), he will remain paralyzed for a much
longer time than if you just hit him with a potion.

After you have paralyzed him, get the book from him and leave the level
ASAP.

If you want to be tricky, you can come back to the level without your
quest artifact or any of the invocation artifacts and try something
sneaky like turning him into a green slime and carefully level draining
him down to level 1 without killing him so that he can't summon
nasties.

